From d2ead1a4fb711c17edaa75e2a456d4830e9add77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Haiku 5.5" <a@b>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 03:54:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rv1126b: clock driver (2 of 6)

Ports Rockchip u-boot-next-dev 1c535d65 drivers/clk/rockchip/clk_rv1126b.c (2013 lines; the
RV1126B CRU tables) and arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/clk_rv1126b.c (the rockchip_get_clk
wrapper, seed lines 1-41), with the clock IDs header include/dt-bindings/clock/rockchip,rv1126b-cru.h
from the seed.

API changes to the v2026.10 driver model (behaviour unchanged):
- priv_auto_alloc_size -> priv_auto; ofdata_to_platdata -> of_to_plat
- clk_set_defaults(dev) -> clk_set_defaults(dev, CLK_DEFAULTS_POST)
- clk_free(&clk) -> clk_release_all(&clk, 1)
- child priv set with dev_set_priv() (seed wrote ->priv directly)
- the seed's softreset_reg binding is replaced by rockchip_reset_bind() (reset-uclass), with
  the same offset (softrst_con[0]) and count (CLK_NR_SRST)
- DM_GET_DRIVER -> DM_DRIVER_GET

Build (scratch, aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc, NO_PYTHON=1): clk_rv1126b.o (driver) and the wrapper
clk_rv1126b.o build with 0 warnings and 0 errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/Makefile       |    1 +
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/clk_rv1126b.c  |   42 +
 drivers/clk/rockchip/Makefile                 |    1 +
 drivers/clk/rockchip/clk_rv1126b.c            | 2008 +++++++++++++++++
 .../dt-bindings/clock/rockchip,rv1126b-cru.h  |  806 +++++++
 5 files changed, 2858 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/clk_rv1126b.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/rockchip/clk_rv1126b.c
 create mode 100644 include/dt-bindings/clock/rockchip,rv1126b-cru.h

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/Makefile b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/Makefile
index bdfa2051..c9e79071 100644
--- a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/Makefile
@@ -8,3 +8,4 @@ ifneq ($(CONFIG_TPL_BUILD)$(CONFIG_TPL_TINY_FRAMEWORK),yy)
 obj-y += syscon_rv1126b.o
 endif
 obj-y += rv1126b.o
